### Mengantar API — REST client file (Lengkap 24 Endpoint)
# Kompatibel dengan VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client, dan editor sejenis.
# Isi variabel di bawah (atau pakai file env editor-mu). @key RAHASIA — jangan commit nilai asli.
# Endpoint TULIS ditandai [WRITE] — jalankan hanya di sandbox.

@base = https://api-public.mengantar.com
@key = GANTI_DENGAN_API_KEY
@prefix = {{base}}/api/public/{{key}}

# Isi setelah menjalankan request pencarian/list di bawah:
@originWilayahId = ORIGIN_WILAYAH_ID
@pickupAddressId = PICKUP_ADDRESS_ID
@destId = DESTINATION_WILAYAH_ID
@timeId = TIME_ID
@batchId = BATCH_ID
@dropshipperId = DROPSHIPPER_ID
@labelGenId = LABEL_GENERATION_ID

### 1. Validasi key (estimate dummy)
GET {{prefix}}/order/estimate?origin_id=5fc62f63f8f44b34aa4c0e0a&destination_id=5fc62de8f8f44b34aa4bdc58&courier=all&weight=1

### 2. Cari data wilayah → ambil data[]._id
GET {{prefix}}/address/search?keyword=menteng

### 3. List alamat pickup (origin) → ambil data[]._id sebagai pickupAddressId, data[].PICKUP_AUTOFILL sebagai originWilayahId
GET {{prefix}}/address

### 4. [WRITE] Buat / in-place update alamat pickup (mendukung pinpointData)
POST {{prefix}}/address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "PICKUP_AUTOFILL": "{{originWilayahId}}",
  "PICKUP_ADDRESS": "Jl. Contoh No. 1",
  "PICKUP_PIC_PHONE": "08123456789",
  "PICKUP_PIC": "Budi",
  "PICKUP_NAME": "Gudang Utama",
  "pinpointData": { "lat": -6.175392, "lng": 106.827153 }
}

### 5. [WRITE] Update alamat pickup by ID
PUT {{prefix}}/address/{{pickupAddressId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "PICKUP_NAME": "Gudang Utama Updated",
  "PICKUP_PIC": "Budi Santoso",
  "PICKUP_PIC_PHONE": "08123456789"
}

### 6. [WRITE] Hapus alamat pickup
DELETE {{prefix}}/address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{pickupAddressId}}"
}

### 7. List jadwal pickup
GET {{prefix}}/time?address={{pickupAddressId}}

### 8. [WRITE] Tambah jadwal pickup — date = mm-dd-yyyy, time = 9:00..18:00
POST {{prefix}}/time
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address_id": "{{pickupAddressId}}", "date": "11-27-2026", "time": "13:00" }

### 9. Estimasi ongkir akun (semua kurir) — key map beda casing dari nama shipment (SAP→Sap, JNECargo→JNE, spx).
# SPX hanya muncul di sini: courier=spx/SPX/... → 400 "Invalid courier". unsupportedOriginSpx:true = tidak tersedia.
GET {{prefix}}/order/estimate?origin_id={{originWilayahId}}&destination_id={{destId}}&courier=all&weight=2

### 10. Estimasi + COD + Dangerous Goods (courier case-sensitive: Sap ✅, SAP ❌)
GET {{prefix}}/order/estimate?origin_id={{originWilayahId}}&destination_id={{destId}}&courier=JNE&weight=2&COD_AMOUNT=150000&isDangerousGoods=true

### 11. Estimasi public (flat 20%) — TANPA prefix key
GET {{base}}/api/order/allEstimatePublic?origin_id={{originWilayahId}}&destination_id={{destId}}&weight=2&isDangerousGoods=false

### 12. Estimasi 3PL (harga standar) — TANPA prefix key
GET {{base}}/api/order/allEstimate3PL?origin_id={{originWilayahId}}&destination_id={{destId}}&weight=2&isDangerousGoods=false

### 13. Skor performa kurir (kirim allEstimateData dari #9)
POST {{prefix}}/order/getPerformancePublic
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "city": "JAKARTA PUSAT", "allEstimateData": {} }

### 14. Invoice & saldo (bisa filter keyword no. resi/order/invoice)
GET {{prefix}}/invoices?page=1&size=20&keyword=ORD-12345

### 15. Assignee (untuk orders.assignee)
GET {{prefix}}/my-users

### 16. [WRITE] Tambah Master Dropshipper (otomatis dedup by nama + no. HP)
POST {{prefix}}/dropshippers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toko Sejahtera Partner",
  "phone": "081234567890"
}

### 17. Cari Master Dropshipper
GET {{prefix}}/dropshippers?search=Toko&page=1&perPage=20

### 18. [WRITE] Buat shipment — resi di data[].cnote_no. JT/SiCepat: jangan paralel! (Ninja discontinued)
POST {{prefix}}/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "courier": "JNE",
  "pickup": { "type": "scheduledPickup", "address_id": "{{pickupAddressId}}", "time_id": "{{timeId}}", "volume": "volumeMobil" },
  "orders": [{
    "customerAddressDataId": "{{destId}}",
    "customerAddress": "Jl. Tujuan No. 5, Bandung, Jawa Barat 40123",
    "customerName": "Siti",
    "customerPhone": "08111111111",
    "parcelContent": "Kaos katun",
    "weight": 2,
    "quantity": 1,
    "goodsValue": 150000,
    "isDangerousGoods": false,
    "dropShipper": {
      "id": "{{dropshipperId}}",
      "name": "Toko Sejahtera Partner",
      "phone": "081234567890"
    }
  }]
}

### 19. [WRITE] Bayar order unpaid
POST {{prefix}}/order/pay-unpaid
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courier": "JNE", "batch_id": "{{batchId}}" }

### 20. Lacak order by order_id
GET {{prefix}}/order?order_id=ORDER_ID

### 21. List order (filter & pagination)
GET {{prefix}}/order?page=1&size=50&courier=JNE&cod=NON_COD&category=collected_customer

### 22. [WRITE] Hapus order
DELETE {{prefix}}/order
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courier": "JNE", "ids": ["ORDER_OBJECT_ID"] }

### 23. List batch
GET {{prefix}}/batch?page=1&size=50&courier=JNE

### 24. [WRITE] Hapus batch
DELETE {{prefix}}/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courier": "JNE", "id": "{{batchId}}" }

### 25. Skor penerima (cek risiko RTS sebelum COD)
GET {{prefix}}/getReceiverScoreByNumberUser?search=8123456789

### 26. [WRITE] Request Cetak Label Asinkron PDF (BETA — Whitelist, max 8 print/menit)
POST {{prefix}}/label-generation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORDER_ID_PAID",
  "courier": "JNE",
  "format": "thermal-10x15"
}

### 27. Cek Status Cetak Label PDF (Read-only)
GET {{prefix}}/label-generation/{{labelGenId}}
